WEBVTT

00:03.052 --> 00:08.152
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:08.252 --> 00:09.719
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

00:11.219 --> 00:12.185
- [sniffs]
- [嗅嗅]

00:12.285 --> 00:13.952
Nope, nothing.
不，没什么。

00:14.052 --> 00:17.519
I can't smell a cent
or a dollar or any money
我闻不到一分钱
或一美元或任何钱

00:17.619 --> 00:18.919
in a five-mile radius.
在五英里半径内。

00:19.019 --> 00:20.819
We might as well
shut her down early.
我们不妨
早点关掉她。

00:20.919 --> 00:22.085
- Eee!
- 呃！

00:22.185 --> 00:24.985
- Just as soon as that guy
finishes his meal.
- 只要那个家伙
吃完饭。

00:25.085 --> 00:27.385
- You mean the guy who's
been nursing a single fry
- 你是说那个人
一直在喂养单个鱼苗

00:27.485 --> 00:28.552
for the last hour?
最后一个小时？

00:28.652 --> 00:31.585
- When he goes,
you can go.
- 当他走的时候，
你可以走了。

00:31.685 --> 00:33.052
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

00:33.152 --> 00:34.585
- [slurping noises]
- [吸吮声]

00:34.685 --> 00:36.352
- Excuse me, sir,
but you seem to be
- 对不起，先生，
但你似乎是

00:36.452 --> 00:37.819
having trouble masticating.
咀嚼困难。

00:37.919 --> 00:39.385
Here, let me help you.
在这里，让我来帮助你。

00:39.485 --> 00:41.919
- [chewing noises
and grunting]
- [咀嚼声
和咕噜声]

00:42.019 --> 00:43.719
[gulps]
[吞咽]

00:43.819 --> 00:45.519
- What, no tip?
- 什么，没有小费？

00:45.619 --> 00:47.452
Finally, yes!
最后，是的！

00:47.552 --> 00:48.819
Leaving early,
早早离开，

00:48.919 --> 00:50.819
I can't believe
this is finally happening.
我不敢相信
这终于发生了。

00:50.885 --> 00:53.719
[thunder rumbles]
[雷声隆隆]

00:55.652 --> 00:56.985
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

00:57.085 --> 00:58.452
'Cause it's not.
因为事实并非如此。

00:58.552 --> 00:59.685
- Oh, my.
- 哦，天哪。

00:59.819 --> 01:01.285
That's quite a storm.
这真是一场风暴。

01:01.385 --> 01:04.385
You know, a storm like this
puts me in the mind
你知道，像这样的风暴
让我铭记于心

01:04.485 --> 01:06.119
of me old Navy days.
我的海军时代。

01:06.219 --> 01:09.552
- Old Navy days?
Ooh!
- 老海军时代？
哦！

01:09.652 --> 01:11.419
- That gives me a fine
idea, SpongeBob.
- 这会给我罚款
想法，海绵宝宝。

01:11.519 --> 01:13.819
Since it looks like we're
gonna be stuck here a while,
因为看起来我们是
会被困在这里一段时间

01:13.919 --> 01:15.819
why don't you pull up
a barrel, me laddies,
你为什么不拉起来
一个桶，我女士们，

01:15.885 --> 01:18.452
while I regale you with
a thrilling tale
当我招待你时
一个惊心动魄的故事

01:18.552 --> 01:21.819
of me mysterious,
salty past.
神秘的我，
咸味的过去。

01:25.385 --> 01:27.685
There now, the lights
are properly dimmed.
现在，灯光
已适当调暗。

01:27.819 --> 01:29.685
Feast yourself on these
slightly expired
尽情享用这些
稍微过期了

01:29.819 --> 01:32.419
soda crackies as I spin you
a yarn that puts
当我旋转你时苏打饼干
一根纱线，把

01:32.519 --> 01:33.652
hair on your chest.
胸部的头发。

01:33.819 --> 01:35.119
- I don't want any
hair on my chest.
- 我什么都不想要
我胸前的头发。

01:35.219 --> 01:36.985
- Ooh, I do.
- 哦，我愿意。

01:37.085 --> 01:38.985
[crunches]
[仰卧起坐]

01:39.085 --> 01:41.719
- It was a day
just like this one.
- 那是一天
就像这个一样。

01:41.819 --> 01:43.819
The wind was howling!
风在呼啸！

01:43.885 --> 01:45.585
And me ship was
being tossed about
我的船是
被抛来抛去

01:45.685 --> 01:48.619
like a ragdoll
on a trampoline.
像布娃娃一样
在蹦床上。

01:48.719 --> 01:50.519
I was in the galley,
cooking up grub
我在厨房里，
煮蛴螬

01:50.619 --> 01:53.619
for me crew to keep their mind
off this horrible squall.
让我的船员保持头脑清醒
摆脱这场可怕的暴风雨。

01:53.719 --> 01:59.819
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

01:59.885 --> 02:02.552
It was just then that he
burst into the galley!
就在这时，他
冲进厨房！

02:02.652 --> 02:03.885
- Who he?
- 他是谁？

02:03.985 --> 02:06.285
- The man whose mission was
to make my life
- 这个人的使命是
让我的生活

02:06.385 --> 02:08.219
a living nightmare.
一场活生生的噩梦。

02:08.319 --> 02:11.885
The roughest, toughest,
scaliest old barnacle
最艰难、最艰难、
最有鳞的老藤壶

02:11.985 --> 02:14.819
that ever roamed
the briny deep.
曾经漫游过的
深海。

02:14.852 --> 02:16.719
He was me commanding officer
他是我的指挥官

02:16.819 --> 02:19.819
and he loathed me
with the white hot hatred
他讨厌我
带着白热化的仇恨

02:19.919 --> 02:21.685
of a psychotic madman!
一个精神病疯子！

02:21.819 --> 02:24.819
They called him
"Captain Scarfish"!
他们称他为
“刀疤鱼船长”！

02:24.885 --> 02:26.819
- Hello!
- [yelps]
- 你好！
- [尖叫声]

02:28.719 --> 02:32.252
- Stand at attention,
Mr. Krabs.
- 立正，
蟹老板。

02:32.352 --> 02:36.852
I want you to tell me
the meaning of this.
我要你告诉我
这的意义。

02:36.952 --> 02:38.352
- Oh, that, sir?
- 噢，那个，先生？

02:38.452 --> 02:40.052
Why, sir, that's
a sea cucumber sandwich, sir,
为什么，先生，那是
先生，一份海参三明治，

02:40.152 --> 02:41.619
with the crusts cut off, sir.
先生，外皮已经被切掉了。

02:41.719 --> 02:44.385
A little booshee amusee
for the boys, sir.
一点 boshee amusee
为了孩子们，先生。

02:44.485 --> 02:46.885
- This is the Navy,
son.
- 这是海军，
儿子。

02:46.985 --> 02:49.152
We don't cut the crusts off.
我们不把外壳切掉。

02:49.252 --> 02:53.952
We eat the crusts
and throw the rest away.
我们吃面包皮
然后把剩下的扔掉。

02:54.052 --> 02:56.852
- But that's--
that's madness.
- 但那是--
这太疯狂了。

02:56.952 --> 03:00.885
- [chewing noises]
- [咀嚼声]

03:00.985 --> 03:03.285
I'm telling you
for the last time,
我告诉你
最后一次，

03:03.385 --> 03:07.419
you're gonna have to stop
making your food so delicious!
你必须停下来
让你的食物如此美味！

03:07.519 --> 03:09.819
- But I don't know how!
- 但我不知道怎么办！

03:09.919 --> 03:12.819
- Well, you better
figure it out.
- 好吧，你最好
弄清楚。

03:12.852 --> 03:16.319
I need my men wild-eyed
and hungry, Krabs.
我需要我的手下睁大眼睛
螃蟹们，饿了。

03:16.419 --> 03:19.819
We've got a cargo hold
full of suntan lotion, and--
我们有一个货舱
满满的防晒霜，还有——

03:19.885 --> 03:21.085
- Wait.
- 等待。

03:21.185 --> 03:23.719
You were transporting
suntan lotion?
你当时正在运输
防晒霜？

03:23.819 --> 03:25.619
[laughs]
[笑]

03:25.719 --> 03:27.819
What SPF?
什么防晒指数？

03:27.852 --> 03:29.719
- I don't see what's
so amusing about that,
- 我没看到是什么
对此很有趣，

03:29.819 --> 03:30.719
Mr. Squidward.
章鱼哥先生。

03:30.819 --> 03:32.152
We were a cargo ship
我们是一艘货船

03:32.252 --> 03:34.885
heading straight
into pirate territory
直行
进入海盗领地

03:34.985 --> 03:37.352
with a fresh supply
of suntan lotion
新鲜供应
防晒霜

03:37.452 --> 03:40.485
for shipwrecked sailors
whose skin was chafed.
对于遭遇海难的水手
皮肤被擦伤了。

03:40.585 --> 03:41.852
- [yawns]
- [哈欠]

03:41.952 --> 03:43.685
- Chafed, Mr. Squidward!
- 生气了，章鱼哥先生！

03:43.819 --> 03:45.652
- Chafed!
- Chafed!
- 生气了！
- 生气了！

03:45.819 --> 03:48.219
- Aye, sir, I understand, sir!
Chafed.
- 是的，先生，我明白了，先生！
恼火了。

03:48.319 --> 03:51.585
- So tonight's meal
is gonna be terrible,
- 那么今晚的饭菜
会很可怕，

03:51.685 --> 03:53.019
you understand me?
- Aye, sir.
你明白我的意思？
- 是的，先生。

03:53.119 --> 03:55.085
- The worst you've ever made!
- Aye, aye, sir.
- 你做过的最糟糕的事情！
- 是的，是的，先生。

03:55.185 --> 03:56.452
- The kind of slop that'll
- 那种斜坡会

03:56.552 --> 03:59.819
put some steel in their spines!
- Aye, aye, sir!
在他们的脊椎上放一些钢！
- 是的，是的，先生！

03:59.852 --> 04:02.819
- Either that, or I'll
throw you in the brig!
- 要么那样，要么我会
把你扔进双桅船！

04:02.885 --> 04:04.352
- Yes, sir.
- 是的，先生。

04:04.452 --> 04:06.152
[overlapping chatter]
[重叠的喋喋不休]

04:06.252 --> 04:07.185
[door opens]
[门打开]

04:08.652 --> 04:09.885
all: Huzzah!
全体：万岁！

04:09.985 --> 04:12.919
- Oh, don't huzzah yet, boys.
- 哦，先别欢呼，孩子们。

04:13.019 --> 04:14.319
- What's on the menu
tonight, eh?
- 菜单上有什么
今晚，嗯？

04:14.419 --> 04:16.519
- Slop.
- 斜坡。

04:16.619 --> 04:18.252
[all laughing]
[全都笑了]

04:18.352 --> 04:20.419
- Oh, slop, eh?
Good one!
- 哦，废话，是吗？
好一个！

04:20.519 --> 04:22.685
Why don't you put some
of that delicious slop
你为什么不放一些
那美味的泥水

04:22.819 --> 04:24.252
right here on my--
就在我这里——

04:24.352 --> 04:27.419
Oh, I bet it's one of those
things that looks bad,
哦，我打赌它就是其中之一
那些看起来很糟糕的事情

04:27.519 --> 04:29.585
but it tastes really--
但味道真的是——

04:29.685 --> 04:31.819
[groans]
[呻吟]

04:31.919 --> 04:33.419
Bad.
坏的。

04:33.519 --> 04:35.419
- [grumbles] Sorry, boys.
- [抱怨] 对不起，孩子们。

04:35.519 --> 04:38.019
Oh, Captain's orders.
噢，船长的命令。

04:40.419 --> 04:43.052
- [retches]
- [干呕]

04:45.919 --> 04:48.219
- Oh, I can't stand it!
- 哦，我受不了了！

04:48.319 --> 04:50.652
I don't care
what the Captain says.
我不在乎
船长说什么。

04:50.819 --> 04:53.685
[triumphant music]
[胜利的音乐]

04:53.819 --> 04:59.385
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

04:59.485 --> 05:00.485
all: Huzzah!
全体：万岁！

05:00.585 --> 05:02.485
Huzzah for Mr. Krabs!
蟹老板先生万岁！

05:02.585 --> 05:03.919
Huzzah!
好哇！

05:04.019 --> 05:06.885
- What's all
this huzzah-ing about?
- 全部是什么
这是关于什么的？

05:06.985 --> 05:08.085
- Oh, nothing, sir.
- 哦，没什么，先生。

05:08.185 --> 05:10.652
They just really
enjoy eating slop.
他们只是真的
享受吃泔水。

05:10.819 --> 05:12.085
Don't you, boys?
不是吗，孩子们？

05:14.919 --> 05:16.552
- Attention!
- 注意力！

05:18.652 --> 05:20.285
Hmm...
唔...

05:20.385 --> 05:22.519
Looks like slop,
all right.
看起来像斜坡，
好吧。

05:22.619 --> 05:23.885
But what's this?
但这是什么？

05:23.985 --> 05:26.819
- Cherries jubilee.
all: Cherries jubilee!
- 樱桃禧年。
全体：樱桃禧年！

05:26.919 --> 05:28.819
- Cherries jubilee?
- 樱桃禧年？

05:28.852 --> 05:31.185
- Well, flaming cherries
jubilee.
- 嗯，火焰樱桃
禧年。

05:31.285 --> 05:33.885
- Flaming? What are you
trying to pull, you lubber?
- 燃烧？你是什么
试图拉，你笨蛋？

05:33.985 --> 05:36.152
This looks like regular
cherries jubilee.
这看起来像常规的
樱桃禧年。

05:36.252 --> 05:37.719
- Well, you see, sir,
I was just gonna
- 嗯，你看，先生，
我正要

05:37.819 --> 05:40.519
take this here match and--
拿这个这里的比赛然后——

05:40.619 --> 05:42.819
[gasps]
[喘气]

05:42.919 --> 05:44.885
And so I found meself
in the brig
于是我发现自己
在双桅船

05:44.985 --> 05:48.152
with two guards watching
me every move.
有两个警卫在注视
我的一举一动。

05:48.252 --> 05:50.819
The one was as brutal
and ugly a bounder
那个人同样残酷
和丑陋的边界

05:50.852 --> 05:54.919
as you'd ever wish to see
in your darkest nightmare.
正如你所希望看到的
在你最黑暗的噩梦中。

05:55.019 --> 05:56.585
- Garr, what are you
looking at?
- 加尔，你是什么？
在看？

05:56.685 --> 05:58.852
- But I thought I could dupe
the other one,
- 但我以为我可以欺骗
另一个，

05:58.952 --> 06:00.419
should the need arise.
如果有需要的话。

06:01.852 --> 06:05.152
[train whistle toots]
- [chuckles]
【火车汽笛声】
- [轻笑]

06:05.252 --> 06:07.652
Gee, Mr. Krabs, that second
guard sounds like
哎呀，蟹老板，那第二个
警卫听起来像

06:07.819 --> 06:09.219
a real goofball!
一个真正的傻瓜！

06:09.319 --> 06:11.119
- I managed to worm
some useful information
- 我设法蠕虫
一些有用的信息

06:11.219 --> 06:12.352
out of him right away.
立刻从他身上消失。

06:12.452 --> 06:14.652
You see, he was
an aspiring cook.
你看，他是
一个有抱负的厨师

06:14.819 --> 06:16.385
And I talked him into
sneaking some things
我说服他
偷偷偷偷拿一些东西

06:16.485 --> 06:19.452
down into the brig for me--
the tools of me trade,
为我进入双桅船——
我交易的工具，

06:19.552 --> 06:20.985
you might say.
你可能会说。

06:21.085 --> 06:23.519
I set him to work
on a spun-sugar cathedral
我让他去工作
在糖丝大教堂上

06:23.619 --> 06:26.119
that took up most of
his attention.
占据了大部分
他的注意力。

06:26.219 --> 06:28.652
He never suspected that I was
using the scraps
他从来没有怀疑过我
使用碎片

06:28.819 --> 06:30.419
to fashion a candy key.
制作一把糖果钥匙。

06:30.519 --> 06:32.952
Where's your sourpuss
friend tonight?
你的酸味在哪里
今晚朋友吗？

06:33.052 --> 06:34.552
- Sick in bed,
like all the men.
- 生病卧床，
像所有的男人一样。

06:34.652 --> 06:36.819
The captain's been feeding them
nothing but moldy
船长一直在喂他们
除了发霉什么都没有

06:36.852 --> 06:38.185
old sandwich crusts.
老三明治皮。

06:38.285 --> 06:40.385
They've all got terrible
belly-aches.
他们都变得很可怕
腹痛。

06:40.485 --> 06:41.419
Not me, though.
但不是我。

06:41.519 --> 06:42.719
I cook for myself.
我自己做饭。

06:42.819 --> 06:45.019
- Wise lad.
- 聪明的小伙子。

06:45.119 --> 06:47.685
- [inhales]
- [吸气]

06:47.819 --> 06:48.819
[dolphin noises]
[海豚的声音]

06:48.885 --> 06:49.885
- And so, after a few hours
- 所以，几个小时后

06:49.985 --> 06:51.219
of bouncing off the walls,
从墙上弹起，

06:51.319 --> 06:53.285
the sugar finally wore off.
糖终于消了。

06:53.385 --> 06:56.185
And soon, he was napping
like a baby.
很快，他就打瞌睡了
像个婴儿一样。

06:56.285 --> 07:00.652
This was me chance
to use me sweet key to freedom!
这是我的机会
使用我通往自由的甜蜜钥匙！

07:00.819 --> 07:03.285
But did I dare take it?
但我敢接吗？

07:03.385 --> 07:06.819
I'd be in violation
of the Naval Code.
我会违规
海军法典。

07:06.919 --> 07:10.585
Then something happened
that made me mind up for me.
然后发生了一些事情
这让我下定决心。

07:10.685 --> 07:12.819
[explosion]
[爆炸]

07:12.852 --> 07:13.885
Pirates!
海盗！

07:13.985 --> 07:15.619
We were under attack!
我们遭到攻击！

07:15.719 --> 07:17.019
I had to act fast.
我必须快速行动。

07:17.119 --> 07:19.352
Wake up, lad, wake up!
醒醒吧，小伙子，醒醒吧！

07:19.452 --> 07:21.485
Man your battle stations!
管理你的战斗站！

07:24.819 --> 07:27.485
[all groaning]
[全都呻吟]

07:27.585 --> 07:30.452
I was on me own.
我独自一人。

07:30.552 --> 07:33.252
I could see it all,
a pirate ship,
我可以看到这一切，
一艘海盗船，

07:33.352 --> 07:37.185
and on that island,
a crew of fine Naval men.
而在那个岛上，
一群优秀的海军人员

07:37.285 --> 07:39.452
Our only hope,
marooned on a beach
我们唯一的希望，
被困在海滩上

07:39.552 --> 07:42.185
by those same scurvy pirates
and suffering
是由那些坏血病海盗所为
和痛苦

07:42.285 --> 07:46.952
from the effects of chafe,
sunburn!
免受擦伤的影响，
晒伤！

07:47.052 --> 07:48.552
The pirates had already
launched a boat
海盗们已经
下水了一艘船

07:48.652 --> 07:50.919
and were preparing
to board our vessel.
并正在准备
登上我们的船。

07:51.019 --> 07:54.619
- Row,
you worthless dogs!
- 行，
你们这些没用的狗！

07:54.719 --> 07:56.019
- Stand down, Krabs.
- 退下吧，蟹蟹。

07:56.119 --> 07:58.119
I'll have you in irons!
我会给你戴上铁镣！

07:58.219 --> 07:59.419
- Listen to me, Captain.
- 听我说，船长。

07:59.519 --> 08:01.819
This is gonna get
real ugly, real fast.
这会得到
真丑，真快。

08:01.885 --> 08:03.585
We've got
to get to the cannons.
我们有
去大炮那里。

08:03.685 --> 08:06.085
- We're not outfitted
for battle, Krabs.
- 我们没有装备
战斗吧，蟹蟹。

08:06.185 --> 08:07.852
There's no ammunition.
没有弹药了。

08:07.952 --> 08:10.819
The cannons are
ornamental at best.
大炮是
充其量只是装饰性的。

08:10.919 --> 08:12.819
Ornamental at best!
顶多是观赏性的！

08:12.919 --> 08:14.685
- Then listen carefully.
- 然后仔细听。

08:14.785 --> 08:16.685
You'll have to go down
to the cargo hold
你必须下去
到货舱

08:16.785 --> 08:19.619
and poke holes in the barrels
of suntan lotion
并在桶上戳孔
防晒霜

08:19.719 --> 08:20.985
and scuttle the ship.
并凿沉这艘船。

08:21.085 --> 08:24.752
- What you're suggesting
is mutiny!
- 你的建议是什么
就是叛变！

08:24.852 --> 08:26.985
- Do as he says, Captain.
- 按照他说的做，队长。

08:27.085 --> 08:29.285
- What are you using
for ammo there, ensign?
- 你用什么
那里有弹药吗，少尉？

08:29.385 --> 08:31.585
- Oh, I rolled up an old
moldy sandwich crust
- 哦，我卷起一个旧的
发霉的三明治外壳

08:31.685 --> 08:32.752
into a hard little ball.
变成一个坚硬的小球。

08:32.852 --> 08:35.185
- That's it!
Come with me, lad!
- 就是这样！
跟我来吧，小伙子！

08:35.285 --> 08:38.352
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

08:38.452 --> 08:45.585
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

08:45.685 --> 08:46.752
[cannon fires]
[大炮开火]

08:49.819 --> 08:51.752
Direct hit!
both: Huzzah!
直接命中！
两人：哈扎！

08:51.852 --> 08:53.519
- You'll pay for that.
- 你会为此付出代价。

08:53.619 --> 08:55.152
Get him, boys!
抓住他，孩子们！

08:55.252 --> 08:56.652
- Uh, what do I do?
- 呃，我该怎么办？

08:56.752 --> 08:59.785
- Get down to the cargo hold
and check on the captain.
- 下到货舱
并检查船长。

08:59.885 --> 09:01.552
Charge!
收费！

09:03.919 --> 09:05.752
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

09:05.852 --> 09:08.519
Close one!
关闭一个！

09:08.619 --> 09:11.819
- Ah, he's kind of handsome
for a crusty old cuss.
- 啊，他有点帅
对于一个脾气暴躁的老家伙。

09:11.919 --> 09:13.219
- [sobbing]
- [抽泣]

09:13.319 --> 09:16.352
I can't do it.
I'm weak.
我做不到。
我很虚弱。

09:16.452 --> 09:19.952
- Snap out of it, man!
-振作起来，伙计！

09:20.052 --> 09:22.419
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

09:22.519 --> 09:23.285
- Ew.
- 呃。

09:23.385 --> 09:25.619
- My personality!
[sobbing]
- 我的个性！
[抽泣]

09:25.719 --> 09:29.419
- Oops, uh, let me
put that back.
- 哎呀，呃，让我
把它放回去。

09:29.519 --> 09:37.485
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

09:48.185 --> 09:51.352
[all speaking happily
at once]
【大家都高兴地说
立刻]

09:54.285 --> 09:58.085
- [grunting]
Missed me!
- [咕哝]
想我了！

09:58.185 --> 09:59.385
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

09:59.485 --> 10:03.185
Uh, anyone for
cherries jubilee?
呃，任何人为了
樱桃禧年？

10:03.285 --> 10:04.319
- Finish him off!
- 干掉他！

10:04.419 --> 10:06.519
sailors: Huzzah for Mr. Krabs!
水手们：为蟹老板万岁！

10:06.619 --> 10:09.385
- Ha, ha, the sunburn brigade!
——哈哈哈，晒伤大队！

10:11.819 --> 10:14.119
Ha, ha, me plan worked!
哈哈哈，我的计划成功了！

10:14.219 --> 10:15.452
[chuckles]
[笑声]

10:15.552 --> 10:18.685
- Handsome and clever,
I see.
- 又帅又聪明，
我明白了。

10:20.819 --> 10:21.985
Join me, Krabs.
跟我一起吧，蟹蟹。

10:22.085 --> 10:24.319
We'll rule the seven seas
together.
我们将统治七大洋
在一起。

10:24.419 --> 10:26.185
- I can't let you go,
lass.
-我不能让你走
姑娘。

10:26.285 --> 10:28.152
I'd be in violation
of the naval code.
我会违规
海军法典。

10:28.252 --> 10:29.385
Enjoy your last meal.
享受最后一餐。

10:29.485 --> 10:33.252
I hope you like spun sugar.
我希望你喜欢白糖。

10:35.819 --> 10:37.652
- Huh?
- 啊？

10:37.819 --> 10:39.585
Oh...
哦...

10:39.685 --> 10:41.352
[chuckles]
[笑声]

10:43.152 --> 10:44.985
- What are we all
winking about?
- 我们都是什么
眨眼什么？

10:45.085 --> 10:46.452
- I don't know!
- 我不知道！

10:51.985 --> 10:59.952
*
*
*
*

*